      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The Clay Centipede detonates in a beautiful incendiary display, filling a 10-foot radius centered on it. All creatures in the radius takes force damage on a failed Dexterity saving throw or half as much on a success based on the rank the Clay Centipede was summoned at. If more than one Clay Centipede is Detonating and the same creature is within more than 1 radius, they make a single saving throw, but increase the damage they take by +2d6 for each additional Clay Centipede explosion radius they are in. B-Rank/A-Rank: 6d6. S-Rank: 8d6.</p>",
